KPL/IK

DART DRACO Instrument Kernel
==============================================================================

   This instrument kernel (I-kernel; IK) contains references to the
   mounting alignment, internal and FOV geometry for the Didymos
   Reconnaissance and Asteroid Camera for OpNav (DRACO) instrument.


